==Route 119==
[[File:Hoenn Route 119 E.png|thumb|Route 119]]

Known for its sweltering heat and [[rain]]falls, the spacious {{rt|119|Hoenn}} runs north from {{rt|118|Hoenn}} to [[Fortree City]]. The extreme weather conditions make this an ideal setting for the [[Weather Institute]], located on the north end of this tropical rainforest. You'll need the [[Acro Bike]] to pick up all the items here.

The area is filled with patches of [[tall grass|long grass]], which prevent using both bikes and hide Trainers and wild Pokémon. One of these wild Pokémon is {{p|Tropius}}, which can learn {{m|Fly}} along with four other [[HM]] moves. It will be very useful if you cannot or do not want to teach those HM moves to the Pokémon that you use in battle.

